<title>USA: CSCE cocoa futures sets new open interest high.</title>
<headline>CSCE cocoa futures sets new open interest high.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange (CSCE) said on Monday total open interest in cocoa futures set a new record high on June 27, 1997, when it reached 105,801 contracts outstanding.</p>
<p>The previous record of 105,561 contracts outstanding was established on April 4, 1997, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk. +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
